D('Hardly had I closed my eyes ___ the alarm went off.','when',{'that':'Hardly kalıbında that kullanılmaz. Hardly had + özne + V3 + when: "-er -mez ...".','than':'than No sooner ile birlikte kullanılır (No sooner had I closed ... than). Hardly ile when gelir.'}),
